### ====================================================================
### SMART CLINIC MANAGEMENT SYSTEM - COMPLETE HTTP API SPECIFICATION
### Tooling: Compatible with IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Seeded Credentials Reference:
# Admin:   admin@smartclinic.com   / admin123
# Doctor:  ramesh@clinic.com       / doc123       (Dr. Ramesh Babu, Cardiology)
# Doctor:  suresh@clinic.com       / doc123       (Dr. Suresh Raina, Neurology)
# Patient: karthik@example.com     / pass123      (Karthik Raja)


### ====================================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & TOKEN ACQUISITION
### ====================================================================

### 1.1 Doctor Login (Dr. Ramesh Babu)
# Automatically extracts and persists JWT to global variable 'doctorToken'
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ramesh@clinic.com",
  "password": "doc123"
}

> {%
    client.test("Doctor login status 200", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Response status is not 200");
    });
    client.global.set("doctorToken", response.body.token);
    client.log("Doctor Token set successfully");
%}

###

### 1.2 Patient Login (Karthik Raja)
# Automatically extracts and persists JWT to global variable 'patientToken'
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "karthik@example.com",
  "password": "pass123"
}

> {%
    client.test("Patient login status 200", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Response status is not 200");
    });
    client.global.set("patientToken", response.body.token);
    client.log("Patient Token set successfully");
%}

###

### 1.3 Patient Registration (New Patient)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Priya Sharma",
  "email": "priya@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "9876543211",
  "password": "pass123"
}

###


### ====================================================================
### 2. DOCTOR CONTROLLER ENDPOINTS
### ====================================================================

### 2.1 [Question 24] Retrieve All Registered Doctors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

###

### 2.2 [Question 26] Search Doctor by Speciality and Time Slot
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/search?speciality=Cardiology&time=09:00
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

###

### 2.3 Get Available Time Slots for Doctor on Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/1/available-slots?date=2026-10-25
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

###

### 2.4 Add New Doctor (Admin / System Setup)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dr. Suresh Raina",
  "email": "suresh@clinic.com",
  "speciality": "Neurology",
  "availableTimes": ["09:00", "11:00", "15:00"]
}

###


### ====================================================================
### 3. APPOINTMENT CONTROLLER ENDPOINTS
### ====================================================================

### 3.1 [Question 25 - Doctor View] Get Appointments for Doctor (ID: 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

###

### 3.2 [Question 25 - Patient View] Get Appointments for Logged-in Patient
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

###

### 3.3 Book an Appointment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/book
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": 1,
  "patientId": 1,
  "appointmentTime": "2026-10-25T09:00:00"
}

###


### ====================================================================
### 4. PRESCRIPTION CONTROLLER ENDPOINTS
### ====================================================================

### 4.1 Save Prescription for Completed Appointment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/prescriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": 1,
  "medication": "Amoxicillin 500mg",
  "dosage": "1 tablet twice daily after meals",
  "notes": "Follow up after 5 days if fever persists"
}

###

### 4.2 Fetch Prescription by Appointment ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/prescriptions/appointment/1
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

###